        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Welcome to <strong>BidetWorld</strong>, where cleanliness, comfort, and care come first. Founded with a mission to revolutionize hygiene, we specialize in high-quality bidet products and professional installation services that cater to every lifestyle.</p><p>At BidetWorld, we believe that everyone deserves a touch of luxury in their daily routine. Our team is dedicated to helping you transform your bathroom into a modern oasis of cleanliness and convenience. With a focus on sustainability and innovation, we offer a wide range of bidet solutions designed to save water, reduce waste, and enhance your personal hygiene experience.</p><p>Whether you’re new to bidets or a seasoned enthusiast, our knowledgeable staff is here to guide you through every step—from choosing the perfect product to ensuring seamless installation. We take pride in delivering exceptional customer service, backed by expert advice and a passion for making your life more comfortable.</p><p>Explore our carefully curated collection of bidets, accessories, and bathroom essentials. At BidetWorld, we’re not just about selling products—we’re about creating a cleaner, more sustainable world for everyone.<br/><em><strong>Clean. Simple. Elevated.</strong></em></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
