            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Remove_background_project_1_1c77a842-d825-4006-930b-5bdf59c624de.png",
            "heading": "Nova : Luxury & Innovation Redefined",
            "text": "<p>Nova bidets represent the pinnacle of modern hygiene, blending sleek design with unparalleled functionality. Engineered for those who appreciate the finer things in life, Nova bidet seats feature advanced sterilization technologies, unlimited warm water, and luxury conveniences such as auto-opening lids and auto-flush capabilities.</p><p>Every detail of Nova bidets is thoughtfully crafted to enhance your daily routine and elevate your bathroom experience. Built with durable, high-quality materials, Nova products provide a seamless combination of style, comfort, and cutting-edge technology.</p><p><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul><li>Sterilization systems for maximum cleanliness.</li><li>Sleek profiles that complement any bathroom decor.</li><li>Unlimited warm water for uninterrupted comfort.</li><li>Luxury features like automated lid opening and flushing.</li></ul><p>Upgrade to Nova and experience the gold standard in hygiene and design.</p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "color_background": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "profile-2": {
          "type": "profile",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/BloomingBidet-NB-R1063-lid-part-open-angle-view-480x572-trans_eff4436b-7ffa-45be-8b0a-7b0871e312d9.png",
            "heading": "Blooming : Balance Style & Performance",
            "text": "<p>Blooming bidets offer an exceptional combination of mid-range affordability and premium features, providing an elevated bathroom experience for discerning customers. With thoughtful design and advanced functionality, Blooming products are ideal for those seeking reliability and style without exceeding their budget.</p><p>Each Blooming bidet seat is equipped with features that prioritize user comfort and convenience, such as unlimited warm water, user-friendly controls, and sleek aesthetics that enhance any bathroom decor. Blooming products are built to last, delivering superior quality and performance with every use.</p><p><strong>Features of Blooming bidets include:</strong></p><ul><li>Unlimited warm water for consistent comfort.</li><li>Stylish and modern designs to suit any home.</li><li>User-friendly controls for a hassle-free experience.</li><li>A trusted choice for mid-range durability and performance.</li></ul><p>Discover the balance of elegance and functionality with Blooming bidets, where value meets superior quality.</p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "color_background": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "profile-3": {
          "type": "profile",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Clean-Sense-1500R-L3QO2-1x1sm.jpg",
            "heading": "CleanSense: Affordable, Functionality",
            "text": "<p>CleanSense bidets are the perfect choice for those seeking exceptional features at a budget-friendly price. Designed to make advanced hygiene accessible, CleanSense products deliver dependable performance with features typically found in higher-priced models. Whether you are new to bidets or upgrading your bathroom, CleanSense offers a perfect balance of functionality and value.</p><p>Crafted with ease of use in mind, CleanSense bidet seats include features such as unlimited warm water, enema wash functionality, and straightforward controls. Their affordability makes them ideal for individuals and families seeking comfort without compromising on quality.</p><p><strong>Key benefits of CleanSense bidets:</strong></p><ul><li>Unlimited warm water for comfort and convenience.</li><li>Enema wash function for enhanced hygiene.</li><li>Affordable pricing without sacrificing essential features.</li><li>Easy installation and intuitive design.</li></ul><p>CleanSense combines innovation with value, making it the smart choice for your home.</p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "color_background": "#000000"
          }
        }
      },
